F制作功能，支持调整动画速度、编辑单帧及分享，并推出GPT-Image-2.6 Flare和Sunburst API以提升生成速度和质量。",{"_51":181,"_175":182},"2026-11-04T18:00:00.000Z","The Verge · AI",false,"uvs1tn1s3b62hlve4z7ei781t","OpenAI 推出 Images 2.6 模型，支持文本与照片生成动画GIF，并开放 Flare（高效）和 Sunburst（高质量）API 模型。用户通过 ChatGPT 和 API 每周生成图像量超40亿，较九月增长1亿。",{"_51":186,"_175":182},"The Decoder",{"_165":166,"_11":167,"_26":168,"_169":188,"_171":19,"_172":173},{"_51":174,"_175":173},{"_192":202,"_11":203,"_18":21,"_15":95,"_195":204},{"_192":198,"_11":199,"_18":180,"_15":95,"_195":200},{"_192":193,"_11":194,"_18":19,"_15":95,"_195":196},"factId","f1wXVMgRvCEU","Introducing Images 2.6","representative",{"_165":166,"_11":167,"_26":168,"_169":197,"_171":19,"_172":173},{"_51":174,"_175":173},"fHkro8npth2w","更新",{"_165":176,"_11":177,"_26":178,"_169":201,"_171":180,"_172":173},{"_51":181,"_175":182},"fVgDmVusc42Q","ChatGPT can now create animated GIFs",{"_165":183,"_11":29,"_26":184,"_169":205,"_171":21,"_172":173},{"_51":186,"_175":182},"participants48h",0,"newParticipants6h","recentReports24h","observationComplete","rank",{"_213":214,"_215":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
